+# Cognitum C15 T2 P2O — Claim Revision and Hypothesis Reconciliation
+
+Research-only source checkpoint. Developed independently; no Lu, GitHub, or real datasets modified.
+
+## New files
+- `proto/cognitum/spatial/v1/structural_reconciliation.proto`
+- `cognitum/proto/spatial_structural_reconciliation_pb2.py` (generated from independently compiled descriptor)
+- `cognitum/spatial_structural_reconciliation.py`
+- `tests/test_c15_t2_p2o_reconciliation.py`
+- `tools/run_c15_p2o_t2_reconciliation.py`
+- `docs/components/spatial/P2O-T2-hypothesis-reconciliation-and-retraction.md`
+- `docs/components/spatial/C15-T2-P2O-reconciliation-backlog-v1.json`
+- `docs/components/spatial/P2O-reconciliation-synthetic-demo.json`
+- `tools/check_proto_descriptors.py` updated with a 64th source/binding schema.
+
+## Reproduce
+```
+PYTHONPATH=. python tools/run_c15_p2o_t2_reconciliation.py
+PYTHONPATH=. python -m pytest -q tests/test_c15_t2_p2o_reconciliation.py tests/test_c15_t2_p2n_ontology.py
+PYTHONPATH=. python tools/verify_protobuf_schemas.py --require
+PYTHONPATH=. python -m pytest -q tests/test_c15* tests/test_c13* tests/test_c14*
+```
+
+The previously recorded six C15 tracking/appearance and three T2 reasoner deferrals are unchanged. Three new P2O independent-validation dependencies are recorded separately. No live source authority, OWL completeness, canonical memory write, Lu approval, or T3 geometry is claimed.
+
+The `P2O_SHA256SUMS.json` file lists SHA-256 values for all other files included in this archive. Its hashes are integrity checks, not attestations of file publisher or trust.
